 "remarks": "Bright and spacious 1-bedroom corner unit in the heart of Stamford! Set on a charming tree-lined street, this sun-filled apartment features a welcoming living room, generous closet space, and a comfortable, functional layout. HEAT, HOT WATER, and COOKING GAS are INCLUDED in the RENT, offering excellent value and convenience. The building provides on-site laundry, along with both on-street and off-street parking options. Enjoy a prime walk-to-everything location near Ridgeway Shopping Center, LA Fitness, medical offices, restaurants, shops, and Scalzi Park. Commuters will appreciate easy access to I-95, the Merritt Parkway, local bus lines, and the Metro-North Train Station. A wonderful combination of space, convenience, and location in vibrant Stamford. Minimum credit score of 700 required. No pets and no smoking.",
